    "teach_5_step": {
      "id": "teach_5_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "So if x+y=40 and xy=375:\n\n1/x + 1/y = 40/375 = 8/75\n\nThe reciprocal question is really a sum-over-product question.",
